WEBVTT

01:12.520 --> 01:17.800
[Meet Yourself]

01:18.720 --> 01:23.000
[Episode 22]

01:50.720 --> 01:52.380
What are you thinking about?

01:54.160 --> 01:58.720
I'm thinking, there are so many stars,

01:59.000 --> 02:00.180
and they are so brilliant.

02:02.240 --> 02:08.720
When I was young, my grandma
used to tell stories for me in the summer.

02:09.720 --> 02:11.600
I was lying in the yard.

02:12.800 --> 02:14.720
My grandma fanned for me.

02:15.920 --> 02:19.440
She told me the legend
of the Cowherd and Weaver Maid.

02:21.120 --> 02:26.680
She said that a new star would appear
in the universe after each person dies.

02:27.920 --> 02:31.920
Then I asked her which one was my grandfather.

02:32.640 --> 02:36.440
She said that it was the one winking at me.

02:40.320 --> 02:41.680
Your grandma was right.

02:42.320 --> 02:47.760
I think that people will blend into
this universe after death.

02:48.680 --> 02:50.200
You believe this too?

02:50.560 --> 02:52.400
I'm an atheist.

02:52.480 --> 02:53.960
I believe in science.

02:55.080 --> 02:58.760
I believe that nothing will truly disappear.

02:59.800 --> 03:02.680
Everything has its own energy.

03:03.360 --> 03:05.176
And energy can't disappear.

03:05.200 --> 03:08.120
It can only be passed and converted.

03:09.120 --> 03:14.760
So becoming a star after death
makes sense to me.

03:17.400 --> 03:22.600
Then would I change to an animal,
a piece of cloud or a tree?

03:25.120 --> 03:27.160
You will change into something you like.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.640
What do you prefer?

03:29.880 --> 03:31.280
What do I prefer?

03:35.480 --> 03:36.960
I'd like to turn into the wind.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.080
Wind?

03:39.360 --> 03:43.160
When I miss someone,
I can blow to him or her gently.

03:43.920 --> 03:45.180
Then he or she would know.

03:48.720 --> 03:51.520
If you want, you can turn into the wind.

03:52.080 --> 03:55.440
Because energy appears when you are thinking.

03:56.680 --> 03:57.840
That's so amazing!

03:58.120 --> 03:58.696
Don't ask,

03:58.720 --> 04:00.000
it's science.

04:06.000 --> 04:07.000
What about you?

04:07.920 --> 04:09.360
What do you like?

04:15.560 --> 04:16.640
I like rain.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.480
So why?

04:29.320 --> 04:33.920
But I believe that
Chen Nanxing will turn into a star.

04:36.200 --> 04:37.400
When she was born,

04:37.400 --> 04:39.680
her dad noticed that it was about daybreak.

04:40.160 --> 04:43.920
The Polaris Australis
was shining right in the south.

04:44.200 --> 04:46.040
So she was called Nanxing.

04:48.480 --> 04:49.600
Polaris Australis?

04:50.760 --> 04:52.320
We are in the Northern Hemisphere.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.280
We can't see it.

04:55.200 --> 04:56.760
When it's dawn,

04:56.760 --> 04:58.080
you can see the Morning Star.

04:58.120 --> 04:59.320
And it's in the east.

05:01.240 --> 05:02.640
We can't see Polaris Australis?

05:03.080 --> 05:04.080
No.

05:04.440 --> 05:05.880
Then her dad may get it wrong.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.440
But it's okay.

05:09.480 --> 05:11.140
She would turn into a star anyway.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.880
There are so many stars blinking.

05:22.600 --> 05:24.240
No one can tell which one is grandma,

05:24.240 --> 05:25.240
or grandfather,

05:25.240 --> 05:26.760
or Chen Nanxing.

05:28.000 --> 05:32.360
No matter where it is, it's looking at you.

05:38.880 --> 05:39.880
Can he see me?

05:41.160 --> 05:42.480
Of course.

05:43.240 --> 05:47.400
They all want you to be happy,

05:47.760 --> 05:48.800
and live a good life.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.400
I always think this way,

05:55.160 --> 05:56.720
and persuade myself.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.880
But I have so many things to regret,

06:07.600 --> 06:08.600
reluctant to leave,

06:10.440 --> 06:11.440
and feel guilty,

06:12.560 --> 06:13.800
and cannot let it go.

06:15.000 --> 06:19.920
You see, we have a lot of time.

06:21.840 --> 06:25.920
But we never come out to travel.

06:29.240 --> 06:32.040
She must have been feeling bad for a long time.

06:37.120 --> 06:44.480
But I never cared about her.

06:51.520 --> 07:04.720
I was not even by her side when she was dying.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.720
She died alone.

07:11.760 --> 07:14.160
Each time when I had fun with you guys,

07:14.160 --> 07:15.880
I would be upset the next second.

07:17.120 --> 07:20.880
It would be better if you know her.

07:21.400 --> 07:23.600
You will like her very much.

07:24.360 --> 07:26.800
Because she was really a good girl.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.200
Then talk about her.

07:38.320 --> 07:39.520
What was she like?

07:47.640 --> 07:52.760
She was a pure and sunshine gurl.

07:53.840 --> 07:55.600
Each time she appears in front of you,

07:56.320 --> 07:57.920
no matter what weather it is,

07:58.320 --> 08:03.640
sunny, rainy, snowy, or even hail or windy,

08:04.840 --> 08:06.600
you would feel that it's a good day.

08:10.720 --> 08:15.760
Is there any magic person
who can let any weather be perfect?

08:19.040 --> 08:20.960
She was my magic heroine!

08:22.680 --> 08:23.720
I believe it.

08:25.320 --> 08:29.640
You are so sad when you think of her,
even she is not here.

08:30.800 --> 08:33.960
But you are so happy to bring her up.

08:39.160 --> 08:40.960
Yes, that's true.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.480
Why?

08:44.080 --> 08:46.160
Because when you bring her up,

08:46.840 --> 08:47.960
she exists.

08:49.440 --> 08:51.120
But when you are not,

08:52.160 --> 08:53.760
she is no longer on this earth.

08:58.320 --> 09:00.840
Compare to others who I don't know,

09:02.080 --> 09:03.880
although I don't know Chen Nanxing,

09:04.880 --> 09:06.040
she exists;

09:08.120 --> 09:10.080
as for the others,

09:10.080 --> 09:14.800
they do not exist to some extent to me.

09:17.920 --> 09:19.240
When you look at me,

09:20.400 --> 09:21.680
when you talk of me,

09:22.680 --> 09:24.160
or think about me again and again,

09:25.680 --> 09:27.160
I am right beside you.

09:42.300 --> 09:44.989
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

09:45.013 --> 09:47.780
♫ Standing in the road ♫

09:48.053 --> 09:51.180
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

09:53.320 --> 09:54.440
The fire is off,

09:56.360 --> 09:58.040
you should be cold now?

10:00.640 --> 10:01.216
A little bit.

10:01.240 --> 10:01.896
Okay,

10:01.920 --> 10:02.696
I'll go get a blanket.

10:02.720 --> 10:09.143
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

10:09.167 --> 10:12.500
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

10:12.787 --> 10:19.380
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

10:20.040 --> 10:23.140
♫ Life we can see ♫

10:24.760 --> 10:26.800
Have some hot tea to warm up.

10:29.047 --> 10:33.500
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

10:37.360 --> 10:38.580
Cover yourself up.

10:39.607 --> 10:44.900
♫ It's just another day ♫

10:52.320 --> 10:54.440
You drank so much in the evening,

10:54.760 --> 10:57.480
You would get up to the toilet at night.

10:58.360 --> 10:59.360
No.

10:59.600 --> 11:02.580
I'm the silver medal winner of
holding pee among the receptionists of my hotel.

11:04.200 --> 11:05.960
Yes, I forgot it.

11:08.680 --> 11:09.880
Then let's compete.

11:10.040 --> 11:11.040
Compete on what?

11:11.480 --> 11:12.480
Holding pee.

11:13.320 --> 11:15.120
Could we compete on something else?

11:16.680 --> 11:18.220
Then let's see who gets sleepy first.

11:18.560 --> 11:20.160
This is nothing better, is it?

11:20.600 --> 11:21.720
So are you in or not?

11:22.240 --> 11:23.216
Yes.

11:23.240 --> 11:23.923
I'm in, I'm in.

11:23.947 --> 11:26.813
♫ Take a long way home ♫

11:27.447 --> 11:34.520
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

11:34.547 --> 11:38.113
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

11:38.207 --> 11:45.080
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

11:45.300 --> 11:48.640
♫ Life we can see ♫

11:54.707 --> 11:59.620
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

12:05.180 --> 12:10.153
♫ It's just another day ♫

12:10.760 --> 12:16.940
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

12:17.327 --> 12:20.900
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

12:21.020 --> 12:27.820
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

12:27.880 --> 12:31.300
♫ Life we can see ♫

12:37.313 --> 12:41.820
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

12:47.467 --> 12:52.660
♫ It's just another day ♫

13:07.680 --> 13:08.616
Xinxin.

13:08.640 --> 13:10.656
You didn't sleep well yesterday,

13:10.680 --> 13:11.680
I can chat with you on the road.

13:11.680 --> 13:12.680
Okay.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.080
Hu,

13:14.320 --> 13:16.320
take Mr. Xie's car later.

13:16.320 --> 13:16.760
Here, this.

13:16.760 --> 13:17.880
Okay.

13:18.520 --> 13:19.520
Xiaxia,

13:19.600 --> 13:20.920
keep it stable on the road.

13:20.920 --> 13:21.920
Okay.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.200
Any places for two bags?

13:28.200 --> 13:29.200
Yes.

13:29.560 --> 13:30.720
Still have the back seat.

13:40.320 --> 13:41.320
Have a check.

13:41.320 --> 13:43.000
See if you forgot anything.

13:44.360 --> 13:46.080
That's all. Nothing else.

13:47.040 --> 13:48.600
I'll send these away in the afternoon.

13:48.720 --> 13:49.800
No worries.

13:49.840 --> 13:52.080
I'll send it to you if anything got lost.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.960
I don't want you to go.

13:56.160 --> 13:58.040
We stay in touch.

14:00.800 --> 14:02.240
Again.

14:02.360 --> 14:04.936
We have had so many farewell meals.

14:04.960 --> 14:05.520
Let's go, go.

14:05.520 --> 14:06.216
Come on, go.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.800
Let's go.

14:07.880 --> 14:08.736
This one only?

14:08.760 --> 14:09.320
Yes.

14:09.320 --> 14:09.720
Okay.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.720
Let's go.

14:33.760 --> 14:34.760
How's it?

14:34.800 --> 14:35.800
Delicious?

14:39.320 --> 14:40.720
A bit weird.

14:41.920 --> 14:43.040
A smell of seafood.

14:44.320 --> 14:46.400
Because I added fish mint.

14:47.400 --> 14:48.840
Why?

14:49.440 --> 14:51.680
You local people like this, don't you?

14:52.320 --> 14:54.080
We don't cook it this way.

15:02.300 --> 15:04.100
[I'm boarding now. No worries.]

15:04.540 --> 15:09.100
[Take care, tell me when you arrive.]

15:13.800 --> 15:14.840
You are not happy?

15:15.480 --> 15:16.800
Damai leaves.

15:21.040 --> 15:22.360
Then would you leave?

15:23.840 --> 15:25.000
I don't.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.920
You will go back sooner or later.

15:28.880 --> 15:31.000
It's not now anyway.

15:33.640 --> 15:34.640
Next year?

15:37.120 --> 15:38.960
Next year is far away.

15:39.680 --> 15:41.920
I don't know, never planned.

15:44.480 --> 15:46.680
You think it's far away,

15:46.920 --> 15:48.840
but time flies.

15:58.840 --> 16:00.320
What's the smell?

16:00.520 --> 16:02.680
I shouldn't have added fish mint.

16:07.920 --> 16:09.680
I didn't dare to say it.

16:17.200 --> 16:19.200
Hongdou hasn't been here for two days.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.400
What's she doing?

16:21.320 --> 16:23.056
A girl is leaving.

16:23.080 --> 16:25.160
So they eat together these days.

16:26.920 --> 16:27.920
Already left?

16:28.160 --> 16:29.160
Yes.

16:29.600 --> 16:32.680
Then ask her to come to eat tonight.

16:32.680 --> 16:34.680
I'll make onion oil tsamba.

16:37.440 --> 16:39.640
Did you hear me?

16:40.360 --> 16:41.760
Yes.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.080
Okay.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.520
So delicious!

17:02.000 --> 17:04.080
Text Yao,

17:04.080 --> 17:05.536
when will he come back for dinner?

17:05.560 --> 17:06.560
Okay.

17:23.320 --> 17:24.176
Grandma,

17:24.200 --> 17:25.840
he said that Aunt Baoping kept him for dinner,

17:25.840 --> 17:27.220
he asked us not to wait for him.

17:28.000 --> 17:29.280
Then let's eat.

18:02.880 --> 18:05.120
Calm down, take it easy.

18:06.040 --> 18:08.880
My dad is too outrageous.

18:08.880 --> 18:11.536
I promised him to go out four days a week.

18:11.560 --> 18:13.576
I even wrote a guarantee.

18:13.600 --> 18:16.160
Then he said he had a present for me.

18:16.320 --> 18:18.816
I...I was looking forward to that.

18:18.840 --> 18:20.920
Then the thing goes like this.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.080
What's wrong with Damai?

18:24.400 --> 18:26.320
Her dad gave her a gift.

18:26.680 --> 18:28.136
Hongdou you are there?

18:28.160 --> 18:29.136
Yes.

18:29.160 --> 18:30.480
I'm here in the kitchen.

18:30.760 --> 18:31.920
Open your camera.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.120
Let us have a look at your gift.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.760
Wait a minute.

18:43.080 --> 18:44.640
It's so cute!

18:44.640 --> 18:46.920
Why are you peeing again?

18:47.360 --> 18:48.760
I'll mop it later.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.936
You think it's cute?

18:52.960 --> 18:56.576
My dad said that
I had to walk him four days a week.

18:56.600 --> 18:57.736
Four days!

18:57.760 --> 19:01.640
And let him pee in the toilet
for the rest of the days.

19:01.960 --> 19:05.520
But you have to walk him every day.

19:05.960 --> 19:09.600
I wouldn't come back if I knew this.

19:09.760 --> 19:11.240
Your dad is so great.

19:11.240 --> 19:14.600
No wonder he is a teacher
who can manage a class of students.

19:15.400 --> 19:15.800
Damai,

19:15.800 --> 19:17.616
I can fully understand you.

19:17.640 --> 19:19.320
You are so poor.

19:20.080 --> 19:21.296
I can't speak to you.

19:21.320 --> 19:22.880
I have to mop the floor.

19:26.560 --> 19:29.060
Noodles in a simple sauce,
eat it now or it's gonna stick together.

19:29.260 --> 19:30.616
I can't guarantee it's delicious.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.640
You put lard oil in it,

19:31.640 --> 19:33.200
how could it not be tasty?

19:42.720 --> 19:44.460
Anything is on your mind these days?

19:46.240 --> 19:47.240
No.

19:48.640 --> 19:49.760
Not willing to leave?

19:51.320 --> 19:52.320
A little bit.

19:52.680 --> 19:54.600
But I can't be at leisure all the time.

19:54.600 --> 19:55.600
Right?

19:56.080 --> 19:58.800
I have to go back
to the normal work and life.

19:59.520 --> 20:00.640
What about you and Mr. Xie?

20:02.040 --> 20:03.480
What?

20:06.600 --> 20:10.880
You watched stars with him
outside the tent the day we went camping.

20:11.200 --> 20:12.360
I saw it.

20:22.120 --> 20:23.016
Xinxin,

20:23.040 --> 20:25.056
you didn't sleep well last night,

20:25.080 --> 20:26.580
let me chat with you along the way.

20:26.740 --> 20:27.940
Okay.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.416
Hu.

20:29.440 --> 20:31.400
Take Mr. Xie's car later.

20:32.400 --> 20:33.400
Xiaxia,

20:33.480 --> 20:34.400
watch it when you put it.

20:34.400 --> 20:35.380
It's not stable on the road.

20:35.380 --> 20:36.380
Okay.

20:37.360 --> 20:38.536
Here, let me.

20:38.560 --> 20:39.560
Come on, Xiaxia.

20:42.200 --> 20:43.200
So what?

20:44.240 --> 20:45.640
What?

20:45.720 --> 20:47.480
You have the chance and catalyst.

20:47.480 --> 20:49.360
Something is happening.

20:49.640 --> 20:51.800
Don't you want some progress?

20:52.880 --> 20:54.000
How?

20:54.320 --> 20:56.400
You can facetime with him.

20:57.240 --> 21:00.400
It's just keeping in touch.

21:00.680 --> 21:08.920
People need to feel the body and smell
to soothe the soul.

21:12.560 --> 21:15.160
When you are in a new environment,

21:15.880 --> 21:16.920
you relax yourself,

21:20.040 --> 21:22.480
you will get some space in your heart.

21:24.840 --> 21:29.520
Someone would walk in accidentally.

21:32.600 --> 21:34.400
But I'm just a tourist.

21:36.640 --> 21:38.040
I don't belong here.

21:40.600 --> 21:42.456
He's already there.

21:42.480 --> 21:43.760
What can you do?

21:45.880 --> 21:47.080
I don't know.

21:47.880 --> 21:50.000
I never met this before.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.880
I have no experience.

21:52.640 --> 21:54.920
So I try not to see him these days.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.400
Hongdou,

21:59.640 --> 22:01.976
are you happy to see him,

22:02.000 --> 22:03.720
or not to see him?

22:06.160 --> 22:07.280
I'm happy to see him.

22:08.780 --> 22:11.300
Have you ever had a secret crush
on someone when you were in school?

22:11.340 --> 22:12.340
Yes.

22:12.400 --> 22:15.760
There was a boy who studied well
when I was in senior high.

22:16.360 --> 22:18.600
We sat across an aisle.

22:19.680 --> 22:21.800
Were you happy just to see him?

22:21.880 --> 22:23.296
When he talked to you,

22:23.320 --> 22:26.296
or even his hand touched your book,

22:26.320 --> 22:28.600
you were excited.

22:29.520 --> 22:30.520
Yes.

22:30.560 --> 22:32.480
Then that's it.

22:32.640 --> 22:34.776
Use your imagination.

22:34.800 --> 22:37.216
What's the difference between now and then?

22:37.240 --> 22:39.216
You are happy to see him.

22:39.240 --> 22:41.000
Then keep that.

22:42.840 --> 22:45.760
Friends will leave anyway.

22:45.800 --> 22:48.240
Make every day happy.

22:48.600 --> 22:51.160
Don't make it hard and listen to yourself.

22:51.400 --> 22:53.120
Your holiday is still on.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.200
Makes sense.

23:00.760 --> 23:02.616
I have more experience on love than you.

23:02.640 --> 23:04.000
I won't cheat you.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.496
I want to be Monkey King!

23:19.520 --> 23:21.240
I want to be Monkey King!

23:21.240 --> 23:23.656
You can only be Pigsy since you lost.

23:23.680 --> 23:24.320
I don't care!

23:24.320 --> 23:26.440
I want to be Monkey King!

23:26.440 --> 23:26.880
Guobao,

23:26.880 --> 23:28.920
can you be Monk Sha?

23:28.920 --> 23:29.760
No!

23:29.760 --> 23:32.600
I want to be Monkey King!

23:37.000 --> 23:38.400
How can you guys bully Guobao again?

23:38.400 --> 23:40.000
I asked you to be friendly.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.200
No one bullied him.

23:41.200 --> 23:43.200
He wants to be Monkey King.

23:43.320 --> 23:45.040
Then let him be.

23:45.040 --> 23:46.600
I'm Monkey King.

23:47.320 --> 23:48.800
Aren't you Ultraman?

23:48.800 --> 23:50.120
Why are you Monkey King now?

23:50.120 --> 23:53.416
But Ultraman wasn't on the journey to the west.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.736
Stop talking.

23:54.760 --> 23:56.736
Let's discuss it.

23:56.760 --> 24:01.296
We just let Ultraman go to the west
without Pigsy, okay?

24:01.320 --> 24:02.560
No, we can't.

24:02.560 --> 24:04.240
We have to take Pigsy.

24:04.360 --> 24:06.800
Ultraman has to stay
in the city to fight against monsters.

24:07.560 --> 24:08.720
Okay, okay.

24:09.080 --> 24:09.880
Guobao, Guobao.

24:09.880 --> 24:11.800
Listen,

24:11.800 --> 24:13.200
you are in the kindergarten now,

24:13.200 --> 24:14.656
who rolls on the ground in your class?

24:14.680 --> 24:15.760
I want to be Monkey King!

24:15.760 --> 24:16.496
Okay.

24:16.520 --> 24:18.520
Jiabao will be back this Sunday.

24:18.520 --> 24:20.120
I'll let Jiabao pull you up.

24:24.080 --> 24:25.400
So you are not rolling?

24:26.680 --> 24:27.680
Come here.

24:29.000 --> 24:31.160
I'll take you to wash your face.

24:31.480 --> 24:32.936
Listen,

24:32.960 --> 24:34.320
you have to be amiable.

24:34.320 --> 24:35.480
Don't make trouble.

24:35.640 --> 24:38.336
If you play Journey To the West,

24:38.360 --> 24:41.400
you have to be Tang Monk, Monk Sha,
Pigsy and Monkey King in turn.

24:41.400 --> 24:42.480
Get it?

24:42.880 --> 24:44.840
No, I am Tang Monk.

24:45.560 --> 24:47.616
Why do you want to be a monk all the time?

24:47.640 --> 24:49.520
Tang Monk has a great dream.

24:49.520 --> 24:50.320
So do I.

24:50.320 --> 24:52.280
So I am Monk Tang.

24:52.320 --> 24:53.216
Okay.

24:53.240 --> 24:54.240
Hulu.

24:54.600 --> 24:57.576
As long as you can learn
addition and subtraction within ten,

24:57.600 --> 24:59.640
you can be a nun or a monk, whatever you like.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.680
Okay?

25:01.800 --> 25:02.200
Okay,

25:02.200 --> 25:03.760
let's wash your face.

25:04.760 --> 25:06.040
Guobao,

25:06.360 --> 25:08.480
you are too old to cry outside,

25:08.520 --> 25:10.040
so embarrassing.

25:17.880 --> 25:18.880
Feng.

25:18.960 --> 25:19.960
I'm here.

25:21.800 --> 25:22.800
Where are they?

25:23.640 --> 25:25.040
They are out for dinner.

25:27.080 --> 25:28.200
What are you gonna eat?

25:28.600 --> 25:29.740
Cornmeal dumpling.

25:31.880 --> 25:33.320
Chang is suffering from anemia.

25:33.320 --> 25:34.160
What do you want?

25:34.160 --> 25:35.600
You also want anemia?

25:36.040 --> 25:37.680
I put eggs in it.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.360
Eggs?

25:39.520 --> 25:41.320
How many are you willing to add?

25:41.360 --> 25:42.840
I know you are stingy.

25:43.440 --> 25:44.800
It's all vegetables.

25:45.080 --> 25:46.520
Stop making this.

25:50.320 --> 25:51.680
I brought you some snacks.

25:52.400 --> 25:54.080
What did Xi send to you?

25:54.080 --> 25:54.960
It's not from Xi.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.280
I made it by myself.

25:59.640 --> 26:01.080
Brown beef spare ribs.

26:01.320 --> 26:02.296
Brown beef?

26:02.320 --> 26:03.440
Have a try, try one.

26:03.720 --> 26:04.720
Try one, try one.

26:09.800 --> 26:10.800
Delicious?

26:11.240 --> 26:12.680
You are so good at it.

26:12.800 --> 26:13.656
It's all yours.

26:13.680 --> 26:14.920
Eat it up.

26:16.080 --> 26:18.520
Look at yourself.

26:18.880 --> 26:20.360
You need more meat.

26:20.360 --> 26:21.360
Do you know?

26:23.080 --> 26:24.640
When Xie Qiang comes out,

26:24.840 --> 26:28.720
if he saw you two both are skinny with diseases,

26:28.800 --> 26:29.840
how would he feel?

26:30.160 --> 26:31.160
How would he feel?

26:32.920 --> 26:34.096
Eat it, eat it.

26:34.120 --> 26:35.360
Eat it up.

26:35.560 --> 26:36.560
Get it?

26:36.960 --> 26:38.580
Let me eat this cornmeal dumpling.

26:41.080 --> 26:42.080
How is it?

26:43.000 --> 26:44.000
Delicious.

26:45.880 --> 26:47.400
Coarse cereals are good.

26:49.240 --> 26:49.960
I don't eat it, I don't.

26:49.960 --> 26:50.360
I don't.

26:50.360 --> 26:51.776
Take one.

26:51.800 --> 26:52.456
No.

26:52.480 --> 26:53.480
You eat it.

26:54.600 --> 26:55.720
I can have this, it's good.

27:08.460 --> 27:11.580
Okay, you pay this first.

27:11.640 --> 27:12.640
Okay.

27:13.360 --> 27:14.096
Bro.

27:14.120 --> 27:17.080
Hongdou is about to leave our cafe.

27:17.800 --> 27:21.200
I considered recruiting a new worker.

27:21.840 --> 27:23.520
I asked you to do it.

27:24.360 --> 27:27.336
I didn't realize the service problem.

27:27.360 --> 27:29.040
Hongdou brought new standards to us.

27:29.040 --> 27:30.480
We should keep them.

27:31.840 --> 27:32.840
Okay.

27:33.040 --> 27:34.060
You can take charge of it.

27:34.440 --> 27:35.460
Then it's on me?

27:36.320 --> 27:36.936
Okay.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.000
I'm going.

27:39.880 --> 27:40.776
Bye.

27:40.800 --> 27:41.840
Bye.

27:56.720 --> 27:57.720
Uncle.

27:58.320 --> 27:59.360
The little pony is good?

27:59.360 --> 28:00.360
Yes, pretty good.

28:01.840 --> 28:02.456
Here.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.720
I brought you some carrots.

28:04.120 --> 28:05.120
Okay.

28:39.720 --> 28:41.160
Why are you running so fast?

28:42.400 --> 28:43.520
I'm asking you questions!

28:48.320 --> 28:49.320
What are you doing?

28:49.360 --> 28:50.480
I don't need to tell you.

28:50.880 --> 28:51.880
Qin!

28:52.240 --> 28:53.240
You!

28:55.460 --> 28:56.460
Second Bro.

29:15.480 --> 29:16.480
What's wrong?

29:17.040 --> 29:18.520
Quarreled with your dad again?

29:20.360 --> 29:22.960
He stopped forcing you
to learn stitchwork, did he?

29:23.280 --> 29:24.720
He doesn't like Yang Zhinan.

29:25.760 --> 29:27.200
Who's Yang Zhinan?

29:28.120 --> 29:29.840
A salesclerk of a homestay in the town.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.120
My boyfriend.

29:32.720 --> 29:34.400
You are in a relationship?

29:36.640 --> 29:37.960
Congrats.

29:38.600 --> 29:40.320
Why doesn't your father like him?

29:40.680 --> 29:43.280
He thinks that he is younger than me,
so he is not a staid man.

29:43.680 --> 29:44.680
How old is he?

29:44.960 --> 29:46.696
19.

29:46.720 --> 29:48.120
5 years younger than you?

29:48.680 --> 29:49.920
So what?

29:50.840 --> 29:52.000
Nothing.

29:52.120 --> 29:54.840
I didn't know it.

29:57.160 --> 29:57.696
Come here.

29:57.720 --> 29:58.720
You know what,

30:00.680 --> 30:02.040
he pursued me.

30:02.160 --> 30:04.416
He used to come to my place to buy something.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.800
I felt weird.

30:05.880 --> 30:08.200
There's a store right in front of his homestay.

30:08.720 --> 30:11.520
So once I asked him if he liked me.

30:11.640 --> 30:13.000
He ran away.

30:13.840 --> 30:14.816
The next day,

30:14.840 --> 30:16.400
he started to order takeouts for me.

30:19.440 --> 30:21.440
It's not because of the takeouts.

30:21.520 --> 30:22.936
I'm not that easy-going.

30:22.960 --> 30:25.480
I asked him to pursue me for a long time
before I said yes.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.200
How long?

30:28.240 --> 30:29.840
More than a week.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.656
Actually, I wanted to say yes on the first day.

30:33.680 --> 30:36.160
Or should I wait till the next March 3rd
to sing it out of love to him?

30:39.360 --> 30:40.920
Your dad is old now,

30:40.920 --> 30:42.536
it's hard for him to keep with your idea.

30:42.560 --> 30:44.040
Don't be mad at him.

30:44.560 --> 30:46.136
I'm not.

30:46.160 --> 30:48.480
He doesn't accept anything I do.

30:48.720 --> 30:51.016
Today we went to cut up scallion,

30:51.040 --> 30:52.256
he cared about my mom,

30:52.280 --> 30:53.600
so he kept my mom home.

30:53.720 --> 30:55.016
I cared about him too,

30:55.040 --> 30:57.160
so I closed my store to go with him.

30:57.320 --> 31:01.056
He kept saying that
I would make trouble for him.

31:01.080 --> 31:03.456
And I was lazy since young
without learning anything.

31:03.480 --> 31:05.536
And Yang Zhinan was bad in every aspect.

31:05.560 --> 31:07.240
So I was really angry.

31:08.680 --> 31:11.360
You have the same temper as your mom.

31:11.920 --> 31:12.840
Yes.

31:12.840 --> 31:14.200
He has to understand me.

31:14.200 --> 31:16.320
This is inheritance.

31:17.720 --> 31:20.376
But he said that I'm silly.

31:20.400 --> 31:22.016
I never learn good things.

31:22.040 --> 31:24.320
I even don't find a good boyfriend.

31:25.120 --> 31:26.896
What is a good boyfriend?

31:26.920 --> 31:29.040
The ones I like are good, right?

31:32.320 --> 31:33.440
You're right.

31:33.920 --> 31:34.920
Right?

31:35.200 --> 31:36.056
Uncle Yao,

31:36.080 --> 31:38.760
your words are always pleasant to hear.

31:40.480 --> 31:43.160
Since you've finished chatting with me,
you can cut scallion now.

31:43.560 --> 31:44.416
It's not that rush.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.520
Let's chat.

31:45.640 --> 31:47.360
Let me care about you.

31:47.680 --> 31:48.976
Tell me the truth,

31:49.000 --> 31:52.240
did you get together with Xu Hongdou?

31:52.440 --> 31:53.896
Again.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.360
I said she was a tenant.

31:55.360 --> 31:56.760
Her term is till next month.

31:57.920 --> 31:59.600
She will leave?

32:00.120 --> 32:02.680
I thought that you liked her.

32:03.440 --> 32:04.880
I like her too.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.600
She is so white.

32:09.280 --> 32:10.456
Uncle Yao,

32:10.480 --> 32:11.840
you are old now,

32:11.840 --> 32:15.296
you would have no girls if you stay negative.

32:15.320 --> 32:16.176
Go to pursue her.

32:16.200 --> 32:17.320
Keep her stay.

32:17.360 --> 32:19.160
It will take you a long time maybe.

32:20.280 --> 32:21.640
You can leave if you are done.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.360
You gabbled too much nonsense,

32:23.360 --> 32:24.560
just like your father.

32:24.840 --> 32:25.640
Uncle Yao,

32:25.640 --> 32:27.360
how could you say that?

32:27.360 --> 32:28.936
What do you mean like my father?

32:28.960 --> 32:30.840
I'm caring about you!

32:30.840 --> 32:31.896
I'm busy!

32:31.920 --> 32:33.360
Mind your business.

32:34.520 --> 32:36.200
My Yang Zhinan is much better.

32:37.400 --> 32:39.760
My Yang Zhinan is the best in this world.

33:04.320 --> 33:05.976
Hongdou likes eating chicken,

33:06.000 --> 33:07.416
call her to come.

33:07.440 --> 33:08.336
Don't call her.

33:08.360 --> 33:10.600
It's too late, she probably is eating now.

33:10.600 --> 33:11.960
Then ask her.

33:12.400 --> 33:13.400
I don't.

33:13.840 --> 33:15.480
Ask her.

33:16.600 --> 33:17.456
No.

33:17.480 --> 33:18.640
You can ask if you want.

33:21.080 --> 33:22.720
Hongdou!

33:22.720 --> 33:23.840
Don't shout!

33:24.960 --> 33:26.600
What's wrong with you?

33:26.680 --> 33:28.056
What's wrong with you?

33:28.080 --> 33:29.840
Why are you asking me to call her?

33:29.960 --> 33:30.840
She is leaving,

33:30.840 --> 33:31.616
do you know?

33:31.640 --> 33:33.120
I know.

33:33.160 --> 33:36.200
So I called her to come to eat.

33:37.560 --> 33:39.040
I know what you are thinking about.

33:39.120 --> 33:40.220
Don't think that way.

33:40.840 --> 33:42.120
What am I thinking?

33:44.120 --> 33:45.176
Say it.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.560
What am I thinking?

33:48.320 --> 33:49.840
Say it, say it.

33:49.840 --> 33:51.096
Grandma,

33:51.120 --> 33:53.280
Xu Hongdou is traveling here.

33:53.360 --> 33:55.320
You have to know the truth,
and stop your illusion.

33:55.360 --> 33:56.736
Don't always call her to eat.

33:56.760 --> 33:58.376
She was just too shy to refuse.

33:58.400 --> 34:00.376
You never asked other tenants to come.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.720
It's not good.

34:06.480 --> 34:08.400
Why are you looking at me?

34:08.440 --> 34:10.360
Call Hongdou to eat here.

34:11.920 --> 34:12.680
Call her if you want.

34:12.680 --> 34:13.720
I'll go out to eat.

34:15.520 --> 34:17.880
Where are you going this late?

34:18.120 --> 34:20.320
Yao, I'm not calling.

34:20.680 --> 34:22.800
I won't call her, okay?

34:41.120 --> 34:41.616
Here.

34:41.640 --> 34:42.480
Yours are ready.

34:42.480 --> 34:43.240
Okay, thanks.

34:43.240 --> 34:44.240
You're welcome.

35:04.240 --> 35:05.240
What's wrong?

35:06.360 --> 35:08.520
You sit here without saying anything.

35:08.680 --> 35:09.680
What's wrong?

35:10.520 --> 35:11.600
You were busy.

35:11.600 --> 35:13.160
Who could I speak to?

35:14.640 --> 35:19.200
Tell me the truth,
is it the bookstore shutting down?

35:20.760 --> 35:22.700
Could you please expect anything good for me.

35:23.200 --> 35:25.040
I want to expect something good.

35:25.240 --> 35:27.216
But you just sit there,

35:27.240 --> 35:28.400
with a bottle of beer.

35:28.480 --> 35:30.160
And not looking good.

35:30.400 --> 35:31.840
Isn't it about breaking down?

35:38.200 --> 35:40.560
I can't be a boss in this life,

35:42.040 --> 35:44.000
I can't bear this pressure.

35:44.840 --> 35:47.760
Each time when I heard that
you broke on this or that,

35:47.840 --> 35:49.760
I'm like sitting on a roller-coaster.

35:49.760 --> 35:50.920
I'm going through ups and downs.

35:50.960 --> 35:52.336
Nothing like a roller-coaster.

35:52.360 --> 35:53.640
It's not the bookstore.

35:55.840 --> 35:59.880
It's my personal reason.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.880
Personal reason?

36:04.480 --> 36:06.200
What's that?

36:16.680 --> 36:18.640
Did Xu Hongdou say anything to you?

36:19.480 --> 36:20.920
What would she say to me?

36:21.000 --> 36:22.400
Then it's you who said something to her.

36:22.400 --> 36:23.616
Nothing.

36:23.640 --> 36:25.200
Then tell her.

36:25.840 --> 36:28.200
It's no use for you
to stay here and drink alone.

36:28.360 --> 36:29.560
You have to tell her.

36:29.840 --> 36:30.840
Say it to her.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.480
What?

36:32.560 --> 36:34.040
Say anything you want to say to her.

36:34.040 --> 36:35.576
I have nothing to say.

36:35.600 --> 36:37.880
Don't pretend that in front of me.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.240
I know you.

36:39.880 --> 36:43.760
You act natural and poised
if you have no secret.

36:44.200 --> 36:46.496
Now you like her secretly,

36:46.520 --> 36:49.440
so you are thievish-looking and shifty-eyed.

36:51.920 --> 36:54.000
See? Just like this.

36:55.080 --> 36:56.080
Hold down your voice.

36:56.080 --> 36:57.320
The kid will hear it.

36:57.840 --> 36:59.400
What does she know?

36:59.640 --> 37:00.640
No worries,

37:01.760 --> 37:03.600
I didn't want to uncover you.

37:05.840 --> 37:09.240
You two are well-matched and have common topics.

37:09.440 --> 37:10.920
Confess to her.

37:12.920 --> 37:15.040
Then what should I do next?

37:15.320 --> 37:16.560
What next?

37:16.840 --> 37:19.040
You could stop chasing her if got refused.

37:20.840 --> 37:23.600
But I feel that she likes you too.

37:26.120 --> 37:27.120
Okay.

37:28.720 --> 37:30.520
Let's put it like this,

37:30.960 --> 37:31.960
then what?

37:32.440 --> 37:33.880
Then what?

37:33.960 --> 37:35.280
You two are together.

37:35.320 --> 37:36.440
How?

37:36.600 --> 37:38.576
You ask me how?

37:38.600 --> 37:40.416
Just be couples.

37:40.440 --> 37:42.400
I don't know how.

37:42.840 --> 37:43.840
I stay here,

37:43.960 --> 37:46.480
and she goes to Beijing,
a long-distance relationship?

37:47.920 --> 37:50.000
Then try to keep her.

37:51.520 --> 37:54.856
Why do you only think of me keeping her stay?

37:54.880 --> 37:56.000
But not me going with her?

37:56.400 --> 38:00.280
Because you can't.

38:00.320 --> 38:01.520
You leave all these behind you?

38:01.520 --> 38:02.640
You go with her?

38:02.880 --> 38:03.816
No, you can't.

38:03.840 --> 38:05.456
Since I can't go with her,

38:05.480 --> 38:07.600
then how could I ask her to stay?

38:08.920 --> 38:14.216
Why do men take it for granted that women should
do more sacrifice and compromise for love,

38:14.240 --> 38:16.376
while men just need a verbal guarantee,

38:16.400 --> 38:18.120
like I would be good to you all my life?

38:23.200 --> 38:24.800
I didn't think this way.

38:25.000 --> 38:29.400
I just feel that
love needs mutual understanding.

38:29.720 --> 38:33.240
You said that I could not go with her,
where's the mutual thing?

38:38.120 --> 38:39.120
Fine, fine.

38:39.680 --> 38:41.056
You like her,

38:41.080 --> 38:42.480
not me.

38:45.320 --> 38:47.000
Then what do you think?

38:47.280 --> 38:49.120
I don't know.

38:49.480 --> 38:51.760
I'm anxious because I have no idea about it.

38:52.360 --> 38:54.096
I miss her when I can't see her.

38:54.120 --> 38:55.120
But when I see her,

38:55.120 --> 38:56.560
I don't know what to say to her.

38:57.120 --> 39:00.440
I just feel that I am like an idiot now.

39:00.440 --> 39:01.440
You know what?

39:04.000 --> 39:06.120
You are being an idiot now.

39:07.680 --> 39:08.176
Okay.

39:08.200 --> 39:09.320
Drink, drink.

39:16.520 --> 39:17.600
I really mean it.

39:17.880 --> 39:19.240
You are thinking too much.

39:19.880 --> 39:22.160
You are thinking too much every day.

39:23.320 --> 39:25.960
I can understand that in your work.

39:26.720 --> 39:28.880
But you also think too much about love.

39:29.000 --> 39:30.000
Are you tired?

39:31.520 --> 39:32.720
In my opinion,

39:32.880 --> 39:34.640
Don't care about the future.

39:34.720 --> 39:35.696
Just be good to her.

39:35.720 --> 39:37.120
Be nice to her.

39:37.720 --> 39:38.936
When she leaves,

39:38.960 --> 39:41.160
she can remember your kindness.

39:45.920 --> 39:46.920
Okay.

39:47.200 --> 39:48.520
Think it over.

40:12.840 --> 40:14.920
Mom, tell me a story.

40:15.080 --> 40:16.680
I can't tell you a story today.

40:16.920 --> 40:18.280
I'm working.

40:18.840 --> 40:21.680
You haven't finished the book
Uncle Yao gave to you.

40:30.080 --> 40:33.720
Mom, I heard about a secret of Uncle Yao today.

40:34.080 --> 40:35.520
What secret?

40:35.720 --> 40:38.520
Uncle likes Sister Hongdou.

40:40.280 --> 40:41.720
That's not a secret.

40:42.320 --> 40:43.840
Mom, he didn't say that.

40:43.840 --> 40:45.520
How did you know?

40:47.080 --> 40:50.816
Because I had that experience.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.800
What experience?

40:59.200 --> 41:02.440
It's a long story.

41:02.440 --> 41:03.856
To be simple,

41:03.880 --> 41:06.976
I had that feeling before.

41:07.000 --> 41:10.240
So I know what's it like when you love someone.

41:10.520 --> 41:12.360
You mean my father?

41:14.880 --> 41:16.880
Before him.

41:17.400 --> 41:19.880
I loved someone else.

41:20.200 --> 41:21.760
Who's that?

41:24.120 --> 41:27.600
He was my desk mate
in my senior year of middle school.

41:28.600 --> 41:30.160
He studied very well.

41:30.320 --> 41:31.240
And then?

41:31.240 --> 41:32.960
He was handsome.

41:33.120 --> 41:35.400
He had dark skin,

41:35.880 --> 41:39.376
and a dimple on the right when he smiled.

41:39.400 --> 41:42.160
What are you talking about as a mother?

41:42.160 --> 41:43.240
Mom!

41:43.360 --> 41:45.160
Why are you eavesdropping?

41:45.160 --> 41:46.400
I didn't.

41:46.400 --> 41:47.520
Go to bed.

41:47.520 --> 41:48.040
Okay.

41:48.040 --> 41:49.400
Go to bed.

42:02.320 --> 42:03.600
Go to bed.

42:04.280 --> 42:06.816
Mom, I want to read before sleep.

42:06.840 --> 42:08.456
Okay, read your book.

42:08.480 --> 42:09.800
I'll play with my phone for a while.

42:38.160 --> 42:40.280
[Why are you sitting over there?]

42:42.560 --> 42:44.816
[Why are you sitting over there?]

42:44.840 --> 42:49.560
[Why are you sitting over there?]

42:51.360 --> 42:55.040
[To feel the wind and dry my hair,
how about you?]

42:56.440 --> 42:57.560
[Feeding the horse.]

43:06.973 --> 43:10.080
♫ I've been alone ♫

43:10.193 --> 43:13.296
♫ Into the unknown ♫

43:13.320 --> 43:14.776
[Okay, go to bed early.]

43:14.800 --> 43:16.863
[I can't sleep.]

43:16.887 --> 43:21.006
♫ Through the dark ♫

43:21.320 --> 43:26.536
♫ I'm searching for a meadow of mine ♫

43:26.560 --> 43:28.483
[What's wrong?]

43:28.507 --> 43:34.729
♫ Till you came in with the breeze ♫

43:34.753 --> 43:37.793
♫ Feeling a rush out of me ♫

43:39.040 --> 43:42.160
[I'm thinking too much.]

43:42.380 --> 43:49.260
♫ I know I will be yours ♫

43:49.600 --> 43:52.229
[Stop thinking too much.]

43:52.253 --> 43:56.326
♫ But this one inside your heart ♫

43:56.900 --> 44:03.376
♫ I'll give you the saddle of my heart ♫

44:03.400 --> 44:06.280
[Okay.]

44:18.760 --> 44:20.909
[Want Creamed Soybean tomorrow?]

44:20.933 --> 44:24.882
♫ Spill my heart to the field ♫

44:24.906 --> 44:25.823
[Watch my gesture.]

44:25.847 --> 44:32.063
♫ I know I'll be yours ♫

44:32.087 --> 44:35.209
♫ Could you ask for any horse ♫

44:35.233 --> 44:39.176
♫ but this one inside your heart ♫

44:39.200 --> 44:41.436
[Go to bed early, I'll call you
tomorrow morning when I get it back.]

44:41.460 --> 44:46.740
♫ The saddle of my heart ♫

44:46.813 --> 44:50.213
♫ You ask me ♫

44:50.360 --> 44:53.840
♫ the wind could sing ♫

44:54.007 --> 45:01.176
♫ We close our eyes to feel ♫

45:01.200 --> 45:04.300
♫ And smile ♫

45:04.560 --> 45:10.030
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

45:12.000 --> 45:16.950
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

45:19.410 --> 45:25.460
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

45:25.780 --> 45:31.160
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

45:34.120 --> 45:39.510
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:41.490 --> 45:46.350
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:48.920 --> 45:55.120
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:55.450 --> 46:01.640
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

46:03.730 --> 46:10.050
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

46:10.170 --> 46:16.920
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

46:18.300 --> 46:20.326
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

46:20.350 --> 46:24.740
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:24.980 --> 46:32.210
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

